OL,3,AFrance halts use of stun grenades after
OL,4,Aboy's hand blown off in student
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe disruption continued early on
OL,8,FWednesday with more than 500 schools
OL,9,Ffully or partially shut, and Prime
OL,10,FMinister Sebastien Lecornu is due to
OL,11,Fspeak about the school protests in an
OL,12,Fevening address.
